 patiently wait to harvest the results of your labor. You can sell your crops, use them in cooking, or even create special potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/297a625312850ff45b2399ddfa9b275a.webp?t=1770287419\" width=618 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/ee77543dbc8dab6a7e178328af05927b.poster.avif?t=1770287419\" width=618 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/ee77543dbc8dab6a7e178328af05927b.webm?t=1770287419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/ee77543dbc8dab6a7e178328af05927b.mp4?t=1770287419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt wildlife and gather their meat to prepare food and open a new specialization. Your survival depends on filling up basic needs and protecting the store from bandits, ghostly soldiers, and cursed skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/extras/a773862c8b39822f36b20e9d1e20e185.webp?t=1770287419\" width=618 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate, operate, and grow your own shop in a medieval-inspired setting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage prices, attract customers, and work to increase the shop's reputation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of customization and decorating options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialize in areas that align with your preferred gameplay style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the game's world, explore a hand-crafted map and delve into abandoned mine shafts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer services to the local community and complete quests.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of special in-game events for added opportunities and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your own animals and use their products to increase your profits.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Unbossed Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261350/header.jpg?t=1770287419","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2261350/870047/8df2d3e96c1d33f5a63de20520b1ee6101897ee5/1750809985/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744735391","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2261350/870047/8df2d3e96c1d33f5a63de20520b1ee6101897ee5/1750809985/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744735391","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2261350/870047/8df2d3e96c1d33f5a63de20520b1ee6101897ee5/1750809985/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744735391","id":257125980,"name":"Livestock Update","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125980/4b0145f4cba89b3be16c0383ec1c44cc9f72ff60/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744735391"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai